      "mozambique/maputo-city": {
        "name": "Maputo Fortaleza, Iron House and seafood",
        "description": "A Portuguese-era capital of markets, cafes, art-deco buildings and fresh prawns.",
        "details": "Maputo has the Fortaleza fort, the Iron House by Eiffel, the railway station and the Central Market. Katembe across the bay has a ferry ride and beach restaurants. Seafood, especially grilled prawns, is a highlight. Go on a guided walk for a first visit.",
        "interests": [
